toryBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>欢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>呼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span>欢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>呼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span>欢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>呼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span>欢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>呼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span>欢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>呼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span>欢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>呼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span>欢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>呼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span>欢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>呼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10618</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai1\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai1.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai1.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai1.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>gundongzimu_1#0.3#18<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……演出很顺利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>看来伊索尔德真的准备演完这出戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>但她究竟是从哪里登台的？后台并没有人见过她……！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_juyuan1\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_juyuan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>很可能是和画展那时一样的暗道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>马库斯，你在看台上看着伊索尔德，我去找海因里希。她一从台上下来，基金会分部的人就会动手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>通讯器联系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>霍夫曼女士起身离开座位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>旁边的听众不满地对她报以注视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯全神贯注地凝视舞台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>光束亮起，投射在这舞台唯一的主角身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她是整个维也纳独一无二的夜莺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而马库斯无心欣赏那些优美的歌曲，只是计算着戏剧的进度。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_yisuoerdewutai2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>gundongzimu_2#0.3#18</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>现在是第二幕，托斯卡被警察局长斯卡比亚逼迫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>她假意答应，要求斯卡比亚给她和恋人签发两张便于逃亡的通行证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>而当斯卡比亚低头签字时……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_juyuan1\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_juyuan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>全神贯注的状态使得视野无限缩小。马库斯甚至能感受到演员歌唱时微微颤动的发梢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>托斯卡俯首在雕像足下，酝酿着一场复仇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯卡比亚：</div><div><i>走哪条路？</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“——最近的路。奇维塔韦基亚港。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小小的纸张自托斯卡的指尖被抽回。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……还差一点，还差一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>托斯卡托起桌上的红色丝绸。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_juyuan4\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_juyuan4\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——而后拿起匕首，刺入了警察局长的心脏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对躺在血泊中的男人，她大笑着——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308115.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308115.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div><i>——这就是托斯卡之吻！</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“斯卡比亚”：</div><div>——啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>等一下，有一点不对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308123.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-308123.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308123.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308123.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-308123.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308123.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-308123.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308123.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div><i>被自己的血呛住了吧……！</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>这个倒在地上的男人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>是分部的卡尔先生？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>他……真的在流血？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯猛地从看台上站起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“阅读”透露的信息令望远镜从她手中滑落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>——什么？你没有看错吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>绝没有，卡卡尼亚小姐！这不是演戏，这是血！卡尔先生的血！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>舞台上的刺杀变成了真实的刺杀……！为什么演出还在继续？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>为什么……为什么观众没有反应？！基金会分部的成员呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>霍夫曼女士！您能听到我吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无人理睬她的呐喊。人们依然全神贯注，保持肃静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通讯器那边也没有声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>——该死的，怎么会这样！！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_juyuan1\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_juyuan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡卡尼亚飞快地冲下座位。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_juyuan4\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_juyuan4\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她奔跑着穿过面色如常的观众们，径直冲到台前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-308013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-308013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-308013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>真的是……卡尔先生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡尔身下的血泊缓缓扩散着，在微冷的空气中蒸腾着热气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308015.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-308015.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308015.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308015.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-308015.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308015.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-308015.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308015.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>为什么，为什么没有人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-308014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-308014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-308014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>你们疯了吗？！难道都没有发现有人死了吗？！演出暂停！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>观众安然地坐着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奏乐也尚在继续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>舞台上，饰演托斯卡的伊索尔德转过身来，露出欣然的神色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308115.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308115.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>卡瓦拉多西，您逃出来了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-308013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-308013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-308013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>什、什么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308115.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308115.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>我可怜的恋人，您只是过于好心，却背负上了政治犯的重罪。我一直想洗刷您的污名。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308115.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308115.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>斯卡比亚威胁我，要我当了他的情妇，与他做恶毒的交易。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308115.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308115.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>——而如今，这个男人终于死了！过去整个罗马曾在他脚下颤栗不安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-308014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-308014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-308014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>你，你在说什么啊，伊索尔德……？这不是《托斯卡》里的情节……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308115.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308115.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>和我一同逃离这里吧！卡瓦拉多西。我拿到了通行证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308115.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308115.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-308115.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308115.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>去一个没有人认识我们的……神圣的、幸福的自由王国！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……这，这是什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“波蒂奥拉卡中毒身亡”……“弗拉斯尼克被枪杀”……还……还有！“赫岑霍夫遇刺”……“希腊国王遇刺”……“弗朗茨大公遇刺”——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>这么多刺杀新闻……在同一天，同一刻……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>掌声自正厅里，自楼座上，自穹顶之下，自不可凝望的天空彼端袭来，汇成这不可阻挡的狂乱之声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如同一场暴雨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div>“——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>马——库斯，计划有变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>出现——了一级紧急事态。立刻——从那里撤离。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "6TH-18"}}